OpenNTFS @VERSION@ - corresponding source code
==============================================

This archive contains OpenNTFS.app, built from:

  Source:   https://github.com/Mchan1970/OpenNTFS/tree/v@VERSION@
  Commit:   @COMMIT@

OpenNTFS is free software, licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 2 or (at your option) any later version. See the LICENSE file next to
this one (also included inside the app at Contents/Resources/LICENSE).

The NTFS engine is libntfs-3g, which is also licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later:

  https://github.com/tuxera/ntfs-3g

A copy of the libntfs-3g sources used for this build is part of the
OpenNTFS source tree above (Vendor/ntfs-3g), with its original copyright
notices.

To build from source, see the section "Build and install from source" in
README.md of the source tree.
